WEBVTT

00:13:58.121 --> 00:14:02.454
One in particular is that we
got to go to conferences.

00:14:02.454 --> 00:14:06.329
And so culture was obviously something
that I was really interested

00:14:06.329 --> 00:14:11.496
and engaged with. So I've got a
culture conferences and again,

00:14:11.496 --> 00:14:13.621
try to build relationships with people.

00:14:13.621 --> 00:14:17.537
It almost sounds like you had a strategy
for disinvesting yourself.

00:14:18.329 --> 00:14:20.121
Yeah, that's exactly what it was.

00:14:20.954 --> 00:14:23.996
And about a year after she
made this plan, she left.

00:14:23.996 --> 00:14:28.329
When I look back and I think
about why I held on

00:14:28.329 --> 00:14:34.246
so much to that job in that position,
I think it's because deep down,